          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "周一。口袋里那封邮件还在：办公时间。带学生证。周一见。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch02/S13.webp",
          "artCue": "S13 食堂广角起：托盘沿近、灯亮、衣服穿好；接上 Ch01 公事邮件",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "characters": ["kai", "hana"],
          "advance": "n_s13_router",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm_dust",
          "setFlags": {
            "ch02_monday": true
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "先得吃饭。食堂的灯比派对亮，也更不给人留面子。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "窗口。水手围裙，工牌一晃。她把热汤往左边一推。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "hana",
              "text": "「热的在左边。别堵道。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "她已经去接下一个人。托盘还烫。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s13_router",
          "type": "dialogue",
